<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Route planning · D’ RAW</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/warehouse-ui.css"><style>
body{font:16px system-ui;color:#251044;background:#fff4e8;margin:0;padding:16px}button,input,select,textarea{font:inherit;min-height:46px;border:1px solid #d4c3e7;border-radius:12px;padding:10px;color:#32115d;background:white}button{cursor:pointer;background:#eee5fa}button:disabled{opacity:.5}.primary{background:#411575;color:white}.danger{background:#fff0f0;color:#a21515}.toolbar,.actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:end;margin:12px 0}label{display:block}label input,label select{display:block;width:100%;margin-top:5px}.board{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,330px),1fr));gap:16px}.card{background:white;border:1px solid #e3d9f2;padding:16px;border-radius:20px;margin:10px 0}.stop{border:1px solid #dfd3ec;border-radius:14px;padding:12px;margin:10px 0}.location{background:#fff4ce;border:2px solid #d8a429}.sent{opacity:.8}small{display:block;color:#6b587e}.notice{padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:#eee5fa;white-space:pre-wrap}.notice:empty{display:none}select,textarea{max-width:100%}.stop select{width:100%}dialog{width:min(94vw,620px);border:0;border-radius:18px;max-height:90dvh;overflow:auto}dialog::backdrop{background:#25104499}dialog label{margin:12px 0}textarea{width:100%}h1{font-size:29px}h2{font-size:23px}.saved{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}#pending{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:20;background:#fff0ce;padding:12px;border-radius:12px}[hidden]{display:none!important}

.route-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px}.route-toggle{background:transparent;font-size:22px;font-weight:750;text-align:left;border:0;padding:4px;flex:1}.stop-count{font-size:14px;white-space:nowrap;border-radius:18px;background:#eee5fa;padding:8px}.drag-handle{display:block;touch-action:none;user-select:none;cursor:grab;margin-bottom:12px;background:#eee5fa;font-weight:700;min-height:48px}.drag-handle:active{cursor:grabbing}.stop>strong{display:block}.dragging-stop{opacity:.3}.drop-active{outline:3px solid #7028ac;outline-offset:3px}.drop-marker{height:5px;background:#7028ac;border-radius:5px;margin:8px 0;pointer-events:none}.drag-ghost{position:fixed;left:0;top:0;width:210px;background:#35116c;color:white;border-radius:14px;padding:12px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px #0005;pointer-events:none;z-index:1000;font-weight:750}.drag-route-tray{position:fixed;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;padding:10px;background:#fff4e8;border-top:2px solid #7028ac;z-index:900;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;max-height:32vh;overflow:auto;box-shadow:0 -5px 20px #0002}.drag-route-tray>strong{width:100%;font-size:13px}.drag-route-chip{background:white;border:2px solid #d8c4ed;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;flex:1;min-width:100px;font-weight:700;text-align:center}.route-stop-list{min-height:35px}#route-count{font-weight:750}#save-status{font-size:13px;color:#655474}#pending{padding:7px 10px!important;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:13px;background:#fff9e9!important;border:1px solid #e7cf92}#pending button{min-height:36px;padding:5px 10px;font-size:13px}#pending details{flex:1;font-size:12px}#pending details p{margin:5px}#unassigned-section>summary{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-size:22px;font-weight:750;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0}#unassigned-section>summary::before{content:'▸';font-size:20px}#unassigned-section[open]>summary::before{content:'▾'}#unassigned-count{margin-left:auto;font-size:14px;border-radius:20px;background:#eee5fa;padding:8px}
.invoice-picker{width:100%;margin:12px 0}.invoice-picker-count{font-size:13px;margin:8px 0}.invoice-picker-list{max-height:min(36dvh,300px);overflow-y:auto;overscroll-behavior:contain;touch-action:pan-y;border:1px solid #d4c3e7;border-radius:12px;padding:6px}.invoice-picker-list .invoice-picker-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;min-height:48px;padding:10px;margin:3px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;cursor:pointer}.invoice-picker-list .invoice-picker-row[hidden]{display:none!important}.invoice-picker-list .invoice-picker-row input{flex:0 0 22px;width:22px!important;min-height:22px;max-width:22px;margin:0}.invoice-picker-row:has(input:checked){background:#eee5fa;border-radius:8px}.invoice-picker input[type=search]{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box}
dialog{box-sizing:border-box;overflow-x:hidden}dialog form{min-width:0}dialog input,dialog select,dialog textarea{box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100%}.invoice-picker-row span{min-width:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}</style></head><body><h1>Route planning</h1><p>Create routes, arrange stops, assign the crew, then send each route to picking.</p><div class="toolbar"><label>Route date<input id="date" type="date"></label><label>Invoice date<input id="invoice-date" type="date"></label><button id="refresh">Refresh</button><button id="auto" class="primary">Auto assign customers</button><button id="create">Create route</button></div><p id="route-count" role="status"></p><span id="save-status" role="status"></span><p id="message" class="notice" role="status"></p><div id="pending" role="status" hidden><span>Save not confirmed</span><button id="retry">Retry</button><details><summary>Details</summary><p id="pending-error"></p></details></div><section class="card" aria-labelledby="invoice-heading"><h2 id="invoice-heading">1. Import invoice stops</h2><label>QuickBooks invoice date<input id="load-date" type="date"></label><p>Choosing this date sets both planning dates. You can override them afterward.</p><div class="actions"><button id="load-invoices" class="primary">Load QuickBooks invoices</button><button id="import-invoices" hidden>Import selected invoices</button></div><p id="invoice-status" role="status">Choose an invoice date above, then load invoices.</p><div id="invoice-list"></div></section><details id="unassigned-section" class="card" data-drop-route="__unassigned" open><summary>Unassigned stops <span id="unassigned-count">0 stops</span></summary><div id="unassigned"></div></details><section class="card"><h2>Saved route names</h2><button type="button" id="manage-saved">Add / remove saved names</button><div id="saved" class="saved"></div></section><section class="card"><h2>Warehouse pickup orders</h2><p>Assign an unassigned invoice using Warehouse pickup. Pick and stage it without a driver, then record collection in Warehouse.</p><div id="pickup-board" class="board"></div></section><div id="board" class="board"></div><details id="sent"><summary>Sent to picking / completed routes</summary><div id="sent-board" class="board"></div></details><script type="module" src="/workspaces-assets/planning.js"></script></body></html>
